 -- Multiprofile Native Maintainers <maintainers@localhost>  Wed, 23 Sep 2026 16:30:00 +0530

multiprofile-native (1.7.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Browser supervisor: crash watchdog with PID checks, bounded restart
    (max 3, backoff) and full CDP grid re-tile; exhaustion stays in error.
  * Durable job queue: SQLite WAL-backed jobs survive restarts; recover()
    re-queues orphaned jobs and marks stuck profiles error at boot.
  * Profile state machine: stopped/starting/running/stopping/idle/parked/
    error with validated transitions and audit notes.
  * Idle parking: park idle profiles (graceful stop, data kept); /proc CPU/mem
    metrics; JSONL profile log + audit trail; /api/metrics/summary.
  * API hardening: cursor pagination, validation errors as 400 invalid_input,
    bearer-token auth for remote requests (localhost exempt), SSE event stream
    at /api/events/stream.
  * Console restyle: sidebar, dense table, wizard, device library, jobs/audit
    views, SSE with poll fallback.
  * Netns: experimental Linux network-namespace support scaffold (NOT ACTIVE,
    default off).

