multiprofile-native (1.6.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Device presets: 33 coherent device identities (Android, iOS-class, iPadOS-class,
    Windows/Linux/macOS-class) with honest capability matrices and genuine CDP
    round-trip validation (VALIDATED/PARTIAL/PENDING/UNSUPPORTED).
  * Fingerprint inspector components: per-component expected values (Navigator,
    Client Hints, Screen, Touch) with device-preset coherence; Screen pins to
    preset viewport x DPR.
  * Profile consistency engine: read-only per-domain checks (geo, device,
    platform, mobile, browser, gpu_webgl) with PASS/WARNING/ERROR semantics.
  * Honest network diagnostics: POST /api/profiles/<id>/network/test returns
    HEALTHY|DEGRADED|DOWN with real measurements or real errors, never placeholders.
  * CDP userAgentMetadata brand shape fix: fullVersionList now uses {brand, version}.
  * Launcher hook: device emulation via CDP; unknown deviceId records a note,
    no traceback; no-Chrome launch fails gracefully without hanging.
  * Azure/WireGuard gateways remain scaffold / not active (provision: not_implemented).

